    {
      "type": "explain",
      "title": "Natural minor",
      "body": "This plain form is called the **natural minor** scale. Its formula is W H W W H W W. A natural minor is A B C D E F G A.\n\n**Why it matters:** There are other minor scales you may meet later, but the natural minor is the one the others start from, and the one most songs use.",
